@baseUrl = https://localhost:7180
@apiKey = clicktopay-dev-key
@encryptedPayload = replace-with-five-part-jwe

### Checkout: what the front gets from checkoutWithCard() -> Mastercard /checkout -> decrypted payload (always with card)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "spiToken": "<PowerTranz SpiToken>",
  "srcDpaId": "823ef281-1a2e-4204-a69c-43d355522a35",
  "srcCorrelationId": "<checkoutResponseData.srcCorrelationId>",
  "merchantTransactionId": "<headers[merchant-transaction-id]>",
  "flowId": "<headers[x-src-cx-flow-id]>",
  "xCorrelationId": "7d1f6c2e-9a43-4b8e-b1a2-3f5c8e0d4a17"
}

### Decrypt an encryptedPayload directly (debugging)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payloads/decrypt
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "encryptedPayload": "{{encryptedPayload}}"
}
